          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വേഴാമ്പൽ — vēḻāmpal — \"a hornbill\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വേഴാമ്പൽ ഉയരമുള്ള മരങ്ങളിൽ താമസിക്കുന്നു. vēḻāmpal uyaramuḷḷa maraṅṅaḷil tāmasikkunnu. The hornbill lives in tall trees."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A big forest bird with a heavy beak; it is the state bird."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "വേഴാമ്പൽ (vēḻāmpal) is a Malayalam bird name whose origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
