          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ദേശാടനം — dēśāṭanaṁ — \"migration (of birds)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തണുപ്പുകാലത്ത് പല പക്ഷികളും ദേശാടനം നടത്തുന്നു. taṇuppukālattŭ pala pakṣikaḷuṁ dēśāṭanaṁ naṭattunnu. In the cold season many birds migrate."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A migrating bird is a ദേശാടനപ്പക്ഷി. The verb phrase is ദേശാടനം (dēśāṭanaṁ) നടത്തുക."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ദേശാടനം (dēśāṭanaṁ) is a Malayalam compound built from two Sanskrit words, deśa, \"a country\", and aṭana, \"roaming about\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
